  m_text: "Our bottles can be recycled but rarelly are. Most bottles end up in water
    or landfills creating environmental and health risks. We won't change our ways
    because it is cheaper to make the consumer reponsible for the waste.\n\nAs long
    as people think recycling works, we'll keep making money.\L\LThank you for training
    with Cuke Corp!"
